        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.432,
            0.293,
            0.456
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.458,
            0.848,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Arrange the stick figure cutouts given at the end of the book or draw a height arrangement such that the sequence reads:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.501,
            0.407,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) 0, 1, 1, 2, 4, 1, 5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.525,
            0.408,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.548,
            0.407,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.573,
            0.407,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.596,
            0.406,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(e) 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.621,
            0.408,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(f) 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 3, 3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.645,
            0.848,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. For each of the statements given below, think and identify if it is Always True, Only Sometimes True, or Never True. Share your reasoning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.706,
            0.815,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) If a person says ‘0’, then they are the tallest in the group."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.73,
            0.738,
            0.751
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) If a person is the tallest, then their number is ‘0’."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.755,
            0.568,
            0.775
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) The first person’s number is ‘0’."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.778,
            0.848,
            0.818
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) If a person is not first or last in line (i.e., if they are standing somewhere in between), then they cannot say ‘0’."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.821,
            0.847,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(e) The person who calls out the largest number is the shortest."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.845,
            0.845,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(f) What is the largest number possible in a group of 8 people?"
            }
          ]
        },
